{"id":67687,"title":"137 | 微服务监控体系总结","content":"微服务监控体系应构建包含系统层、应用层、业务层及端用户体验层的四层轻量架构。系统层聚焦硬件与基础设施，推荐以 Zabbix 为主，辅以 Prometheus 加 Grafana 实现细粒度监控；应用层涵盖中间件与框架指标，主要采用 Prometheus 集成 Spring Boot Actuator 或 Micrometer，并结合 CAT 进行链路追踪、ELK 处理日志，复杂告警场景可补充 Zabbix 的 Python 脚本能力；业务层关注订单、支付等核心指标，通常由 Prometheus 覆盖，特殊规则沿用 Zabbix；端用户体验层则依据规模选择自研或听云等第三方服务。\n\n参考架构上，日志（Log）通过 Logstash 采集，经 Kafka 缓冲存入 Elasticsearch，由 Kibana 展示；链路追踪（Trace）利用 CAT 客户端上报至服务端；指标（Metrics）通过 Exporter 或客户端暴露，由 Prometheus 抓取并配合 Alertmanager 发送多渠道告警。该体系强调全栈覆盖，不仅监控微服务本身，还需对 Kafka、ELK、CAT 等基础组件进行指标采集与告警。企业可据此基础架构起步，随业务发展逐步演进为高可用、可扩展的分布式监控平台，持续优化埋点精度与告警灵敏度。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":46070,"user_name":"寒武三叶虫","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1136240,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A93B9DF0AD0CE0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/56/70/f5175b5b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1543841626,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":16605,"content":"对，openfalcon是小米运维同学开发，偏系统监控","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1543929044,"ip_address":"","comment_id":46070,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"跟跟视频中系统层监控作用类似吧应该？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":431325,"discussion_content":"对，openfalcon是小米运维同学开发，偏系统监控","content_length":27,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1543929044,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":4